// check_program()'s own block is full (mid/names/limits/shape/block/more/check.id),
// so its last action calls here instead of chk_dead() directly.
//
// The decomposition warnings (docs/PROJECT.md, "decomposition warnings") run
// last: they read the whole parsed program, same as the checks above, but
// report on stderr and never call note_failure, so a violation here never
// changes what check_failed() answers.
check_program_tail() {
  chk_dead();
  check_program_tail2();
} return void;

check_program_tail2() {
  check_genname();
  check_fwd();
  check_loose_dup();
} return void;
